{
  "SPDX-License-Identifier": "GPL-3.0-only",
  "name": "CHAOS Lab 1 · Ember Veil (evolving pad)",
  "description": "Play held chords for a warm, slowly wandering stereo pad. Smooth near-sine A/B oscillators remain mostly parallel while the comb body adds a quiet halo; a poly ADSR gives a long release. Independent slow LFOs animate body mix and cutoff; clocked smooth random supplies sparse per-voice micro-detune and body drift. CHAOS gate stays unconnected so release is audible. Expose: shape_a, shape_b, detune, body_mix, feedback, cutoff, drift, ADSR attack/release, and random range/smooth. Future internal option: seeded smooth-random LFO shape.",
